      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>So far I think we've made two small changes from the RDF serializer:</p>\n\n<p>1. Saving binary descriptions at their URIs instead of at the binary's URIs (so we can support multiple descriptions of a binary)<br/>\n2. Replacing any colons in a filename with underscores (because #1 results in \"fcr:metadata\" in filenames).</p>",
     "created": "02/Sep/16 2:29 PM",
     "id": "17356",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12063/comment/17356",
